## Notes & gotchas

- Tracker `settingsValidator` blocks if ANY configured column id no longer exists on the
  reporting board — when restructuring, null out keys that point at deleted columns.
- JSON import **merges** into existing settings (doesn't replace) — a stale value survives
  unless its key is explicitly present in the imported file.
- Status labels referenced by **label id** (read back via `settings`), never positional index.
- Re-run `provision.py` (idempotent) to rebuild boards; re-run `seed.py` to reseed data.
- Before importing any saved settings file, run the monday-ops schema-drift guard:
  `python3 <monday-ops>/scripts/guard.py <settings.json>`. After any rebuild, run
  `python3 <monday-ops>/scripts/validate.py <config.json>`.
